# Trading bot — layout (actief)

- **`src/rangebot/`** — Config, `strategy.range_strategy`, `exchange.kraken`, execution, Telegram, journal, `main`, **`live/`** (`run_loop`, `daily_report`, `cancel_all_orders`).
- **`kraken/`** — `python -m kraken.live_trader`; `kraken_runtime.py`.
- **`bot_live/`** — Alleen backward-compat `python -m bot_live.*` → `rangebot.live`, plus shims (`config`, `telegram`, `journal`).
- **`scripts/run_bot.py`** — `rangebot.main`.
- **`tests/`** — Pytest.

`BITVAVO_*`-feeconstanten in `settings` zijn historische namen voor maker/taker in journal/backtest (zelfde getallen).
